Here's a simple **Tic Tac Toe** game implemented using **HTML**, **CSS**, and **JavaScript** with the following features:

- Dark-themed background.
- A timer for each player's move.
- Basic win/draw handling.

---

### ✅ Features:

- Players take turns (X and O).
- 10-second timer per move. If time runs out, the turn is skipped.
- Game ends on win/draw.

---

## 🧩 Code

### 🔹 `index.html`

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Tic Tac Toe with Timer</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Tic Tac Toe</h1>
  <div id="timer">Time left: <span id="time">10</span>s</div>
  <div id="board"></div>
  <div id="status"></div>
  <button id="restart">Restart Game</button>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```

---

### 🔹 `style.css`

```css
body {
  background-color: #121212;
  color: #ffffff;
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  text-align: center;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 20px;
}

h1 {
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

#timer {
  font-size: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

#board {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 100px);
  gap: 5px;
  justify-content: center;
  margin: 20px auto;
}

.cell {
  width: 100px;
  height: 100px;
  font-size: 2em;
  background: #1e1e1e;
  color: #ffffff;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  cursor: pointer;
